    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d200">

                <pb facs="0318" n="216" xml:id="pg216"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 6775/507.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Buchanan to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San Jose Costa Rica</hi></placeName>,<lb/><date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1908-05-27"><hi rendition="#italic">May 27,
                                1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The judges here, representing Costa Rica, Guatemala, Honduras, Nicaragua,
                    Salvador, have handed me telegrams from their Governments expressing
                    appreciative thanks our Government for efforts Washington conference culminating
                    in inauguration court.</p>
                <p>As they referred to Mr. Creel and myself separately, I have acknowledged courtesy
                    by telegraph in each case.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Buchanan.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
